      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Step 2: Let \\( a_1 = x \\), \\( a_2 = y \\), \\( b_1 = \\sqrt{1 - y^2} \\), and \\( b_2 = \\sqrt{1 - x^2} \\). Applying the Cauchy-Schwarz inequality gives us:\n\\[ (x \\sqrt{1 - y^2} + y \\sqrt{1 - x^2})^2 \\leq (x^2 + y^2)((1 - y^2) + (1 - x^2)). \\]",
      "z": 0.646732178512293
