      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 3,
      "text": "Step 3: Simplify the right-hand side of the inequality:\n\\[ (x^2 + y^2)((1 - y^2) + (1 - x^2)) = (x^2 + y^2)(2 - x^2 - y^2) = 2(x^2 + y^2) - (x^2 + y^2)^2. \\]",
      "z": 0.8878148431534516
